    "user_request_original": "Optimize a 16-layer HfO2/SiO2 dielectric stack on fused silica substrate for dual-band filtering. Incident medium: Air. Layer sequence: HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2 (16 finite layers, starting with HfO2, ending with SiO2). Initialize thicknesses using quarter-wave optical thickness at 550 nm center wavelength. Optimize all 16 thicknesses as continuous variables with step-tolerance ≤0.05 nm. Disable integer-rounding post-processing. Initialize candidate pool from Round 3 decimal thickness values (113.5-158.0 nm range) perturbed by ±1.5 nm Gaussian noise. Wavelength bands: maximize transmittance at 1530-1565 nm, maximize reflectance at 400-700 nm. Use gradient_thickness optimizer with learning rate 0.025. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 1530-1565 nm, 400-700 nm. soft objectives: High transmittance in 1530-1565 nm band; High reflectance in 400-700 nm band. behaviors to suppress or avoid: Low reflectance in 1530-1565 nm band; Low transmittance in 400-700 nm band. manufacturing constraints: Maximum 30 layers.",
